      "source": "A simple <a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a> implementation that registers only a\nreflection hint for the annotated type. Can be sub-classed to customize\nprocessing for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> type.",
      "translation": "一个简单的 <a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a> 实现，仅注册已注解类型的反射提示。可以将其作为子类以针对给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> 类型自定义处理。",
